# Network tier

**Goal:** full WebPs + aerial cinema when earned. **Resilience:** light path must stay usable (`-light.webp`, static cinema, no MP4).

## Must preserve

- Session `full` | `light`. Unknown → light; `markLight()` locks; upgrade only via prove / restored `full`.
- Build: full WebP (1600) + `-light.webp` (800), q80; emit then prune around `vite build`.
- Dev: committed JPEG/PNG; tier still drives cinema. SEO/OG/JSON-LD: always full via `publicImage()`.
- Come arrivare light: static map only — no Leaflet/OSM tiles.
- Cinema: never block page; never autoplay with sound. Stall/timeout → light → static end poster.
- Reduced motion shares static cinema UX with light tier (triggers stay separate in code).
- No site-wide `srcset` yet. Keep tier/prove in `network-*.ts`; buffer/session in `ambient-video.ts`; cinema layout in homepage `+page.svelte`.
- Update `ambient-video.test.ts`, `network-tier.test.ts`, `network-prove.test.ts` when tier/buffer/control rules change.

## Tier signals

| Signal | Result |
|---|---|
| sessionStorage `light` / `full` | Restore (`light` locked) |
| Save-Data or slow-2g / 2g / 3g | `markLight()` |
| Prove: `mappa` light fetch ≤ 800ms | `markFull()` else `markLight()` |
| MP4 buffer stall / prepare timeout | abort → `markLight()` → static cinema |

`initMediaTier()` in site layout on client.
